// Stage 4 map: every colony family on one map. Yellow (you, Ants) versus Red (bot, Spiders); the
// Beetle, Scorpion and Wasp colonies start neutral and must be captured (destroy, then collect bits).
// Original rule in force: melee units cannot damage colonies - use grenadiers / bazookas.
// Neutral flyers (dragonflies here, "normal" tileset) and pirate ant holes are enabled.
(
    name: "Five Families",
    description: "Ants (you) vs Spiders (bot). Capture the neutral Beetle, Scorpion and Wasp colonies to breed their bugs. Watch for dragonflies and pirate ants.",
    width: 96,
